Changes made in this distribution
---------------------------------
- Documented and supported for Autodesk Revit 2025, 2026 and 2027. The package
  also carries upstream's Revit 2022-2024 add-ins so its checksums verify.
- Added install.ps1, a wrapper that runs the unmodified setup/install.ps1 and
  then copies the server to Documents\Codex\rvt-mcp for the Codex desktop app.
- Added README.md and docs/ written for this distribution, including client
  configuration for Claude and Codex.
- Added checksum verification (tools/verify.ps1, tools/verify.py), CI checks and SECURITY.md.
- No modifications to upstream source code or to any file inside setup/.
- Updated from v0.5.0 (Revit 2027 only) to v1.2.2.

